[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2103.19, "timestamp": "00:35:03", "text": "接下来。你好吗？一个罕见的，一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2116.95, "timestamp": "00:35:16", "text": "哦，我得去打扫一下了。拉屎。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2123.75, "timestamp": "00:35:23", "text": "是的。哦，等等。我没有空间。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2131.39, "timestamp": "00:35:31", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2134.47, "timestamp": "00:35:34", "text": "呃，那又怎么样呢？哦，我们得打扫卫生。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2136.79, "timestamp": "00:35:36", "text": "搞定。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2145.589, "timestamp": "00:35:45", "text": "呃，把蘑菇拿出来。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2147.75, "timestamp": "00:35:47", "text": "我认为我们要填满“什么是”这个问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2150.43, "timestamp": "00:35:50", "text": "那？呃，晚上"}]